\ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\insrsid15875786 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i Ch\'ednh h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc d\'e1n tem h\'e0ng ho\'e1 nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu nh\'fd sau:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 
\par 1. H\'e0ng ho\'e1 thu\u7897\'3fc }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 danh m\u7909\'3fc m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng ph\u7843\'3fi d\'e1n tem h\'e0ng nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu (sau \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi l\'e0 h\'e0ng ho\'e1 ph
\u7843\'3fi d\'e1n tem) khi nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu \'f0\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi d\'e1n tem h\'e0ng nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu.
\par Danh m\u7909\'3fc m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng ph\u7843\'3fi d\'e1n tem \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc qui \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c Th\'f4ng t\'fd Li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch s\u7889\'3f: 77/1997/TTLT/BTC-BTM-BNV-TCHQ ng\'e0y 01/11/1997, s\u7889\'3f
 30/1998/TTLT/BTC-BTM-BNV-TCHQ ng\'e0y16/3/1998, s\u7889\'3f 121/1998/TTLT/BTC-BTM-BCA-TCHQ ng\'e0y 01/9/1998, s\u7889\'3f 46/1999/TTLT/BTC-BTM-BCA-TCHQ ng\'e0y 05/5/1999 c\u7911\'3fa Li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i Ch\'ednh- B\u7897\'3f Th\'fd
\'f5ng M\u7841\'3fi- B\u7897\'3f C\'f4ng An - T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc H\u7843\'3fi quan (Ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc 1- k\'e8m Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y).
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 H\'e0ng h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 o\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng \'fdu \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'e3i, mi\u7877\'3fn tr\u7915\'3f ngo\u7841\'3fi giao, n\u7871\'3fu }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn ki\u7875\'3fm tra th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f
, th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'ec kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi d\'e1n tem. Ch\u7911\'3f h\'e0ng ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft Vi\u7879\'3ft nam v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu, ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f h\'e0ng nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu. 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 2. H\'e0ng ho\'e1 ph\u7843\'3fi d\'e1n tem kh\'f4ng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn ki\u7875\'3fm tra th\u7921\'3f
c t\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 khi l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc h\u7843\'3fi quan \'f0\u7875\'3f nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu. 
\par 3. H\'e0ng ho\'e1 ph\u7843\'3fi d\'e1n tem ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng quan sau khi ch\u7911\'3f h\'e0ng \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'e3 d\'e1n tem (theo }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c Th\'f4ng t\'fd Li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch d\u7851\'3fn tr\'ean) cho to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f l\'f4 h\'e0ng.
\par 4. C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng h\'e0ng do ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi khai h\u7843\'3fi quan khai, Chi c\u7909\'3fc H\u7843\'3fi quan l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu cho l\'f4 h\'e0ng c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7911\'3f
 tem cho ch\u7911\'3f h\'e0ng. 
\par Ch\u7911\'3f h\'e0ng ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc d\'e1n tem t\u7841\'3fi n\'f5i ki\u7875\'3fm tra th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 d\'fd\u7899\'3fi s\u7921\'3f gi\'e1m s\'e1t c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng ch\u7913\'3fc H\u7843\'3fi quan.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af301 \ltrch\fcs0 \f301\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 Vi\u7879\'3fc d\'e1n tem ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo tem \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'e3 d\'e1n th\'ec kh\'f4ng th\u7875\'3f}
{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786  b\'f3c ra \'f0\u7875\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng l\u7841\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc. Ch\u7911\'3f h\'e0ng ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'e1
p lu\u7853\'3ft n\u7871\'3fu d\'e1n tem kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\'fang y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu n\'e0y.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 5. Nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng ch\u7913\'3fc H\u7843\'3fi quan gi\'e1m s\'e1t vi\u7879\'3fc d\'e1n tem:
\par - Ph\u7843\'3fi gi\'e1m s\'e1t ch\u7863\'3ft ch\u7869\'3f trong su\u7889\'3ft th\u7901\'3fi gian ch\u7911\'3f h\'e0ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc d\'e1n tem.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 - Ph\u7843\'3fi ki\u7875\'3fm tra l\u7841\'3fi vi\u7879\'3fc d\'e1n tem c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f h\'e0ng, n\u7871\'3fu ph\'e1t hi\u7879\'3fn chi\u7871\'3fc tem n\'e0o d\'e1n kh\'f4ng 
\'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'ec y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu ch\u7911\'3f h\'e0ng d\'e1n l\u7841\'3fi.
\par - C\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm xem x\'e9t v\'e0 x\u7917\'3f l\'fd s\u7889\'3f tem b\u7883\'3f r\'e1ch, b\u7883\'3f h\u7887\'3fng trong khi d\'e1n v\'e0 l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'fd\u7907\'3fng tem th\u7915
\'3fa, thi\u7871\'3fu theo qui \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c Th\'f4ng t\'fd Li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch d\u7851\'3fn tr\'ean.
\par 6. Th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn c\u7917\'3fa kh\u7849\'3fu \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi h\'e0ng nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi d\'e1n tem:
\par - \'d0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn, th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn c\u7917\'3fa kh\u7849\'3fu th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 53/2003/Q\'d0-BTC ng\'e0y 16/4/2003 c
\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i Ch\'ednh v\u7873\'3f th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc h\u7843\'3fi quan \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi h\'e0ng h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 o\'e1 xu\u7845\'3ft kh
\u7849\'3fu, nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu chuy\u7875\'3fn c\u7917\'3fa kh\u7849\'3fu. 
\par - Ngay sau khi l\'e0m xong th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn c\u7917\'3fa kh\u7849\'3fu cho l\'f4 h\'e0ng, Chi c\u7909\'3fc H\u7843\'3fi quan c\u7917\'3fa kh\u7849\'3fu nh\u7853\'3fp c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm th\'f4ng b\'e1o cho Chi c\u7909
\'3fc Qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd Th\u7883\'3f tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'fd\u7901\'3fng t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f tr\'ean tuy\u7871\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng t\u7915\'3f c\u7917\'3fa kh\u7849\'3fu v
\u7873\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa \'f0i\u7875\'3fm l\'e0m ti\u7871\'3fp th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc cho l\'f4 h\'e0ng, \'f0\u7875\'3f ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp gi\'e1m s\'e1t v\'e0 cho Chi c\u7909\'3fc H\u7843\'3fi quan l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc cho l\'f4
 h\'e0ng, \'f0\u7875\'3f theo d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'f5i, ti\u7871\'3fp nh\u7853\'3fn.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 - Nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng b\'e1o c\u7911\'3fa C\'f5 quan H\u7843\'3fi quan Chi c\u7909\'3fc Qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'fd Th\u7883\'3f tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'fd\u7901\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng c\'f3 li\'ean quan ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1m s\'e1t c\'e1c l
\'f4 h\'e0ng tr\'ean theo ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo c\u7911\'3fa th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f t\u7841\'3fi v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn 1862/VPCP-V.I ng\'e0y 18/4/2003.
\par Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc sau 15 ng\'e0y k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y \'f0\'e3ng c\'f4ng b\'e1o.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 B\'e3i b\u7887\'3f qui }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af309 \ltrch\fcs0 \f309\insrsid6647364\charrsid15875786 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh "C\'f5 quan H\u7843\'3fi quan th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc d\'e1
